Package: pollofpolls
Type: Package
Title: Load and Analyse European Poll of Polls Data
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Peter",
                  family = "Reschenhofer",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "peter.reschenhofer@gmail.com")
Description: Downloads national voting intention polls published by POLITICO's
    "Poll of Polls" project and provides poll aggregation methods (Kalman
    filtering and smoothing, weighted rolling means) similar to those used by
    POLITICO and the original pollofpolls.eu website, seat projections and
    house effect estimates. Polls, election results and trends are returned as
    'data.table' objects and can be visualised with base graphics or
    'ggplot2'.
URL: https://github.com/petres/pollofpolls, https://petres.github.io/pollofpolls/
BugReports: https://github.com/petres/pollofpolls/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    curl,
    data.table,
    grDevices,
    graphics,
    jsonlite,
    stats,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    ggplot2,
    KFAS,
    testthat (>= 3.2.0),
    withr
